  "solution": "**Symbols**\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n\n \n \n**Meaning**\n\n \n \n \n÷\n\n \n \n \n×\n\n \n \n \n+\n\n \n \n \n-\n\n \n \n \n\n1. 10 - 2 + 3 ÷ 9 × 2 = 8\n\n⇒ __**10 **____**÷**____** 2**__ × 3 - 9 + 2 = 8\n\n⇒ __**5**____** ×**____** 3**__ - 9 + 2 = 8\n\n⇒ **__15__** - 9 __**+ 2**__ = 8\n\n⇒ **__17__**__** - 9**__ = 8\n\n⇒ 8 = 8\n\n2. 10 + 3 - 2 × 9 ÷ 2 = 21\n\n⇒ 10 × __**3 ÷ 2**__ + 9 - 2 = 21\n\n⇒ __**10 **____**×**__**__ 1.5__** + 9 - 2 = 21\n\n⇒ **__15__**__** +**____** 9**__ - 2 = 21\n\n⇒ **__24__**__** -**____** 2**__ = 21\n\n⇒ 22 ≠ 21\n\n3. 20 + 6 - 4 × 9 ÷ 6 = 32\n\n⇒ 20 × __**6 ÷ 4**__ + 9 - 6 = 32\n\n⇒ __**20 × 1.5**__ + 9 - 6 = 32\n\n⇒ __**30 + 9**__ - 6 = 32\n\n⇒ __39____** - 6**__ = 32\n\n⇒ 33 ≠ 32\n\n4. 20 ÷ 9 × 9 - 4 + 6 = 33\n\n⇒ 20 - 9 + __**9 ÷ 4**__ × 6 = 33\n\n⇒ 20 - 9 + __**2.25**____** ×**____** 6**__ = 33\n\n⇒ __**20**__ - 9 __**+ **__**__13.5__** = 33\n\n⇒ **__33.5__**__** - 9**__ = 33\n\n⇒ 24.5 ≠ 33\n\nHence, ‘**10 - 2 + 3 ÷ 9 × 2 = 8**’ is the correct answer.",
